s around the end of the 15th century, as well as by a second hand not yet definitively identified.</dc:description><dc:format>I-II + 263 ff., 39 x 28 cm</dc:format><dc:identifier>doi:10.5076/e-codices-bge-fr0076</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/bge/fr0076</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>Genève, Bibliothèque de Genève, Ms. fr. 76</dc:identifier><dc:publisher>e-codices - Virtual Manuscript Library of Switzerland</dc:publisher><dc:language>French</dc:language><dc:relation>Notice de Paule Hochuli Dubuis, Bibliothèque de Genève, pour e-codices, 2014.</dc:relation><dc:rights>e-codices / Genève, Bibliothèque de Genève (cf. http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/about/terms)</dc:rights><dc:source rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/bge/fr0076"></dc:source><dc:title>Genève, Bibliothèque de Genève, Ms. fr. 76 : Quintus Curtius Rufus, Faits et gestes d’Alexandre</dc:title><dc:type>Manuscript</dc:type><dcterms:medium>Parchment</dcterms:medium><edm:europeanaProxy>false</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_bge_fr0076"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/9200211/en_list_one_bge_fr0076"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_bge_fr0076"><dc:creator rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/agent/60208"></dc:creator><dc:date rdf:resource="#1475%7E%2F1500%7E"></dc:date><dc:type rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/concept/17"></dc:type><dcterms:medium rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/concept/2092"></dcterms:medium><edm:europeanaProxy>true</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_bge_fr0076"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_bge_fr0076"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><edm:EuropeanaAggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/a